{"content":"<html>\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/assets/css/topnav.css\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/assets/css/new.css\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"/assets/css/modal.css\">\r\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/4.7.0/css/font-awesome.min.css\">\r\n\r\n<body onload=\"startTime()\">\r\n\r\n<div class=\"topnav\" id=\"myTopnav\">\r\n  <a href=\"index.php\">Home</a>\r\n  <a href=\"javascripts.php\">JavaScripts Tests</a>\r\n  <a href=\"thm.php\">TryHackMe write-ups</a>\r\n  <a href=\"#\">Tech Write-ups</a>\r\n  <a href=\"#\">Gallery</a>\r\n  <a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" class=\"icon\" onclick=\"myFunction()\">\r\n  <i class=\"fa fa-bars\"></i>\r\n  </a>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n  <main id=\"content\" class=\"banner\">\r\n  <section class=\"bannercontainer\">\r\n    <div class=\"bannercontent\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"content-title\">J is for .JammY.uK</h2>\r\n    <div class=\"maintext\">\r\n    <p>Maybe a cool subheader here?.</p>\r\n    </div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"more grid\">\r\n  <div class=\"more-content\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"content-title\">JavaScript</h2>\r\n    <p>Just practicing on some in built javascript here...<p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <main id=\"content\" class=\"main\">\r\n  <section class=\"maincontainer\">\r\n  <div class=\"contentbox\">\r\n    <p id=\"demo\">Javascript can change HTML.</p>\r\n    <button type=\"button\" onclick='document.getElementById(\"demo\").innerHTML = \"Hello JavaScript!\"'>Click me!</button>\r\n    <br>\r\n    <br>----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\r\n    <br>\r\n    <div id=\"txt\"></div>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"more grid\">\r\n  <div class=\"more-content\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"content-title\">A new look...</h2>\r\n    <p>So you may see that the layout has completely changed to my previous site, and that is becaue I had way to much code which eventually broke my site.<p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n\r\n  <section class=\"twins grid\">\r\n  <div class=\"twin\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"content-title\">\"Knowledge is power, guard it well.\"</h2>\r\n    <p>Just a cheeky little blood ravens quote from warhammer 40.</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  <div class=\"twin\">\r\n    <h2 class=\"content-title\">Hmmmmmm</h2>\r\n    <p>So I am not sure what to do with these boxes just yet.... Will see..</p>\r\n  </div>\r\n  </section>\r\n  </main>\r\n\r\n  <footer class=\"colophon grid\">\r\n    <aside>Hi.</aside>\r\n    <aside>Bye.</aside>\r\n  </footer>\r\n\r\n  <script src=\"/assets/js/topnav.js\"></script>\r\n  <script>\r\n  function startTime() {\r\n    var today = new Date();\r\n    var h = today.getHours();\r\n    var m = today.getMinutes();\r\n    var s = today.getSeconds();\r\n    m = checkTime(m);\r\n    s = checkTime(s);\r\n    document.getElementById('txt').innerHTML = h + \":\" + m + \":\" + s;\r\n    var t = setTimeout(startTime, 500);\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  function checkTime(i) {\r\n  if (i < 10) {i = \"0\" + i};\r\n  return i;\r\n  }\r\n  </script>\r\n\r\n  </body>\r\n</html>\r\n"}
